Package: maithicstats
Title: Statistics for Maithic Runs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("The Maithic Authors", email = "maintainers@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns the result files written by the 'maithic' command into
    estimates with honest uncertainty: binomial intervals for success rates,
    bootstrap intervals for any metric, and paired comparisons of two
    configurations on the same problems. Summaries cover benchmark runs, the
    prover, the trust ledger, gateway usage and retrieval evaluation, and each
    comes with a table ready for a report.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
